{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香港は暖かかすぎて\n日中は夏みたいだったよ！\n暑かった(´｡･o･｡`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観光名所回ったよ～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界三大夜景の\nヴィクトリアピークからの眺め！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度見ても綺麗！\nだけど風が強い！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風で前髪喪失。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーももちろん行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願だったアナ雪のアナに会えて\nサインもらえて幸せ...(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちが行く前日に\nミッキーミニーが新しいお顔になってて\nとってもプリティーでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グリーティングが1番好きだから\nキャラクターとたくさん会える\n香港ディズニーは\n私の中で最高のパーク(°▽°)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り物は\nミスティックマナーが本当におすすめ！\nあの世界観は\nTHEディズニーって感じなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本にも出来てほしいなあー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいご飯もたくさん食べたよ！\n火鍋、おかゆ、飲茶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回行っても飽きない香港！\n人も優しくて\n駅とかも分かりやすくて\nご飯も美味しくて\n過ごしやすい香港(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつか行きたいなあ～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカで旅行もまた行きたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/01/06/0434329/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}